      {
        "id": "model-maxterm-index",
        "moduleId": "maxterm-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "两套记法为何相反却不矛盾",
        "markdown": "两种项的编号规则刻意相反：最小项把原变量记 1、反变量记 0；最大项把原变量记 0、反变量记 1。\n\n但结果并不矛盾——同一下标对应同一组变量取值。$m_{6}=AB\\overline{C}$ 在 $110$ 时为 1，而 $M_{6}=\\overline{A}+\\overline{B}+C$ 恰好也在 $110$ 时为 0。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-minterm",
            "tb-maxterm"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-minmax-relation",
        "moduleId": "min-max-relation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "最小项与最大项互为反函数",
        "markdown": "以三变量为例，利用反演规则可得：$\\overline{m_{0}}=A+B+C=M_{0}$、$\\overline{m_{1}}=A+B+\\overline{C}=M_{1}$、$\\overline{m_{7}}=\\overline{A}+\\overline{B}+\\overline{C}=M_{7}$。\n\n观察可见，下标编号相同的最大项与最小项互为反函数。推广到 $n$ 变量：$\\overline{m_{i}}=M_{i}$，且 $\\overline{M_{i}}=m_{i}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000100"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "最小项与最大项的关系"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1535,
              "lineEnd": 1556,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "dcfce545e6db7d49124ed68060b50247e85a774b2cf20c7b78a13c6a6e4efbb1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-relation-rule",
        "moduleId": "min-max-relation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "用反演规则记这条关系",
        "markdown": "用反演规则记忆最稳：对一个最小项整体取反，“与”变“或”、原变量变反变量、反变量变原变量，得到的正是同下标的最大项。\n\n因此两个下标集合可以互推：知道一个函数用到了哪些最小项，就同时知道它用到了哪些最大项，反之亦然。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-minmax-relation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-standard-overview",
        "moduleId": "standard-sop",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "标准式的两种类型",
        "markdown": "逻辑函数表达式的标准式主要有“标准与或式”和“标准或与式”两种类型。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000101"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "标准式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1557,
              "lineEnd": 1560,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "541fbc9adfd32c41a5fc9ce46b23b50008ad4628b90d080859cf0fc6900db8d1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-standard-sop",
        "moduleId": "standard-sop",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "标准与或式（最小项表达式）",
        "markdown": "**标准与或式（最小项表达式）**：由若干个最小项相或构成的逻辑表达式。任何一个逻辑函数表达式都可以表示成唯一一组最小项之和。\n\n求法有两种：\n\n- 拆项法：利用 $A+\\overline{A}=1$ 对乘积项缺少的变量配项，再用分配律展开；\n- 真值表法：真值表每一行实质上就是一个最小项，把输出为 1 的所有最小项相或。\n\n【例 2-8】写出 $Y=AB+\\overline{B}C$ 的最小项表达式。\n\n拆项法：$Y=AB(C+\\overline{C})+(A+\\overline{A})\\overline{B}C=ABC+AB\\overline{C}+A\\overline{B}C+\\overline{A}\\overline{B}C=m_{1}+m_{5}+m_{6}+m_{7}=\\sum m(1,5,6,7)$。\n\n真值表法得到同一结果：$Y$ 在 $(A,B,C)$ 为 $001$、$101$、$110$、$111$ 时为 1，对应 $m_{1}$、$m_{5}$、$m_{6}$、$m_{7}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000102"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "标准与或式(最小项表达式)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1561,
              "lineEnd": 1584,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "408aecd3a8b69535c1d9e3663f4108d54780f9d0ee1e07e1f29a675294ae3856"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-sop-steps",
        "moduleId": "standard-sop",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "拆项法的三步流程",
        "markdown": "拆项法可以拆成固定三步：\n\n1. 逐个检查乘积项，看缺少哪些变量；\n2. 用 $X+\\overline{X}=1$ 补齐缺失变量并展开；\n3. 把展开得到的全部最小项按下标从小到大排列。\n\n以 $Y=AB+\\overline{B}C$ 为例：$AB$ 缺 $C$，补成 $ABC+AB\\overline{C}$；$\\overline{B}C$ 缺 $A$，补成 $A\\overline{B}C+\\overline{A}\\overline{B}C$。四项按下标排序后即为 $m_{1}+m_{5}+m_{6}+m_{7}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-standard-sop"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-standard-pos",
        "moduleId": "standard-pos",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "标准或与式（最大项表达式）",
        "markdown": "**标准或与式（最大项表达式）**：由若干个最大项相与构成的逻辑表达式。任何一个逻辑函数表达式都可以表示成唯一一组最大项之积。\n\n由于最小项与最大项互为反函数，可以先求最小项表达式，再求最大项表达式。\n\n【例 2-9】写出 $Y=AB+\\overline{B}C$ 的最大项表达式：\n\n$$Y=m_{1}+m_{5}+m_{6}+m_{7}=\\sum m(1,5,6,7)=\\overline{\\sum m(0,2,3,4)}=\\overline{m_{0}}\\cdot\\overline{m_{2}}\\cdot\\overline{m_{3}}\\cdot\\overline{m_{4}}=\\prod M(0,2,3,4)$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000103"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "标准或与式(最大项表达式)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1585,
              "lineEnd": 1594,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "694e1f4906d58efc6cf18e246e7c1ddcff95130e2274a7fd5dcdaac7e5dc48fc"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-pos-index",
        "moduleId": "standard-pos",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "最大项下标取补集",
        "markdown": "从标准与或式换成标准或与式，只用一条规则：最大项的下标集合等于全部 $2^{n}$ 个下标扣掉最小项用到的下标。\n\n例 2-8 的 $Y$ 在 $1,5,6,7$ 处为 1，那么在剩下的 $0,2,3,4$ 处为 0；把使 $Y=0$ 的那几行写成最大项再相与，就得到 $\\prod M(0,2,3,4)$。注意“取反”会把最小项之间的“或”变成最大项之间的“与”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-standard-sop",
            "tb-standard-pos"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simplest-intro",
        "moduleId": "simplest-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "最简式的意义与分类",
        "markdown": "用化简后的逻辑表达式构造电路，可以使电路结构更简单，电路工作更稳定、可靠。最简表达式分为最简与或式、最简与非-与非式、最简或与式、最简或非-或非式、最简与或非式。化简时通常先化为最简与或式，再按需要转换成其他形式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000104"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "最简式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1595,
              "lineEnd": 1598,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "aa228d9a7724425962d3208d315cc280a1423af27a83588cf265f11e2c022d79"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simplest-sop",
        "moduleId": "simplest-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "最简与或式",
        "markdown": "**最简与或式**：乘积项最少，并且每个乘积项中的变量也最少的与或表达式。例如：\n\n$$Y=\\overline{A}B\\overline{E}+\\overline{A}B+A\\overline{C}+A\\overline{C}E+B\\overline{C}+B\\overline{C}D=\\overline{A}B+A\\overline{C}+B\\overline{C}=\\overline{A}B+A\\overline{C}$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "最简与或式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1599,
              "lineEnd": 1606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f4ade11cd67b71b571d5ff7de3a9a1a0bde46aacc63e9c14842b59ed9ec8e98c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simplest-nand",
        "moduleId": "simplest-forms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "最简与非-与非式",
        "markdown": "**最简与非-与非式**：非号最少，并且每个非号下面乘积项中的变量也最少的与非-与非表达式。做法是在最简与或式基础上两次取反，再用摩根定律整理：\n\n$$Y=\\overline{A}B+A\\overline{C}=\\overline{\\overline{\\overline{A}B}\\cdot\\overline{A\\overline{C}}}$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000106"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "最简与非-与非式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1607,
              "lineEnd": 1616,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "40815d90767a92882cad2310a5126abd87f096aedfa4479a625c123fac754c9e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simplest-pos",
        "moduleId": "simplest-forms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "最简或与式",
        "markdown": "**最简或与式**：括号最少，并且每个括号内相加的变量也最少的或与表达式。若 $Y=\\overline{A}B+A\\overline{C}$，先求反函数的最简与或表达式：\n\n$$\\overline{Y}=(A+\\overline{B})(\\overline{A}+C)=\\overline{A}\\overline{B}+AC+\\overline{B}C=\\overline{A}\\overline{B}+AC$$\n\n再利用反演规则写出函数的最简或与表达式：$Y=(A+B)(\\overline{A}+\\overline{C})$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d9c2cd46140d4ed6be3b9a6f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000107"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "布尔代数和逻辑化简",
                "最简或与式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1617,
              "lineEnd": 1626,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "48d2f0a4fd832bbd8f6adbfe46ce01af68df0f62705e74941fb7807305d6de7b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simplest-nor",
        "moduleId": "simplest-forms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "最简或非-或非式",
        "markdown": "**最简或非-或非式**：非号最少，并且每个非号下面相加的变量也最少的或非-或非表达式。先求最简或与式，再两次取反，最后用摩根定律去掉下面的非号：\n\n$$Y=(A+B)(\\overline{A}+\\overline{C})=\\overline{\\overline{A+B}+\\overline{\\overline{A}+\\overline{C}}}$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
